<title>HONG KONG: Robert Fleming sets China Res warrants.</title>
<headline>Robert Fleming sets China Res warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Fleming &amp; Co Ltd said it intended to issue 175 million American-style call warrants on shares of China Resources Enterprise Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$13.82     PREMIUM	    18.49 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.342     GEARING	    4.3X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  11.DEC.97    MIN EXER LOT     20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    SETTLEMENT DATE  07.JAN.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$14.55     LISTING DATE     09.JAN.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p>	 -- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
